[size=6][b]FasterDealers Mod for Schedule 1[/b][/size]

This is a simple mod to make all drug dealer NPCs walk faster with a configurable speed. Cross-compatible with both IL2CPP (main branch) and Mono (alternate beta branch)!

[b]Supported Versions[/b]
[list]
[*][size=2][color=#00ff00]v0.4.6f11[/color] (Gamepad Support update)[/size][/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://melonwiki.xyz/#/?id=requirements]MelonLoader v0.7.0[/url]﻿﻿[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/schedule1/mods/1194]S1API Forked by ifBars v3.1.9+﻿﻿﻿﻿[/url][/*]
[/list]

[size=4][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Make sure you have the requirements listed above.[/*]
[*]Download and install from Thunderstore Mod Manager or Nexus Mods.[/*]
[*]Download and extract the `FasterDealers.dll` file into your game's mod directory, e.g. `C:\Program Files\Steam\Steamapps\common\Schedule 1\Mods`[/*]
[/list]

[b][size=4]Configuration[/size][/b]
You can configure this mod in the following file: "<Schedule 1 directory>/UserData/MelonPreferences.cfg".


[b][size=3]Default Config[/size][/b]
[code][FasterDealers]
Enabled = true
SpeedMultiplier = 3.0﻿[/code]


